    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Value | 4-Bedroom Village Residence \r\n\r\nSinead Coughlan Estate Agent is delighted to present this 4-bedroom bungalow in the heart of Feenagh Village, Ideally situated within walking distance of local amenities, this well-presented residence is perfect for first-time buyers, families or those looking to downsize, while enjoying the tranquillity of village life.\r\nFor those commuting to Limerick, the property is approximately a 35-minute drive to Raheen Business Park, making it an attractive option for those working in Limerick City and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nCall Sinead to set up a viewing appointment 087-4050663."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen, Integrated Appliances, Tiled floor and back-splash,  Center Island, sliding door to patio,\r\nOpen Plan Living Room and Dining Room, Wood Floors, Wall Panelling, and Full wall of Sliding Glass Doors to Garden,\r\nUtility Room with Built in Storage,\r\nMain Hall Bathroom, with walk in electric shower, pedestal and wc, fully tiled.\r\nMaster bedroom with wood floors and fireplace.\r\n2nd Bedroom with wood floors\r\n3rd bedroom with wood floors\r\n4th Bedroom with wood floors."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Property Highlights.\r\n\r\n4 spacious bedrooms\r\nMain hall bathroom with large walk-in shower\r\nSeparate mud room / utility area\r\nModern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\r\nBright and spacious open-plan living & dining room\r\nLarge rear extension creating excellent additional living space\r\nOpen fireplace\r\nParking for 2 cars\r\nFront and rear gardens\r\nGarden shed and outdoor W.C.\r\nBuilt circa 1950\r\nWalking distance to local school, shop and village amenities\r\nExcellent potential to further extend, subject to planning permission\r\nBER Rating: F\r\nApproximately 13km to Ballingarry\r\nApproximately 16km to Newcastle West\r\nApproximately 25km to Adare Village\r\nApproximately 35-minute commute to Raheen Business Park"
      },
      {
